    "Why do we give so much weight to the opinions of strangers? One answer is that reviews seem to come from people like us. An advertisement is written by someone who wants to sell a product, but a review appears to be written by someone who has simply used it. {a|We tend to believe that a person with nothing to gain from our decision is more likely to tell us the truth.}",
